<title>USA: Holbrook, Mass. won by Fidelity Capital.</title>
<headline>Holbrook, Mass. won by Fidelity Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Capital Markets Inc. said it won $4.800 million of Holbrook, Mass., municipal purpose loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.179 percent.</p>
</text>
